    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Titanic Survival\r\n\r\nContinue investigating passenger survival with a second visualization.\r\n\r\n**Data Question:** How did passenger survival compare across classes?\r\n\r\n1. Run the starter code and review the stacked bar chart.\r\n2. Group the data by `Survived` and use `size()` to count the passengers in each group.\r\n3. Create a pie chart with clear category labels, percentages, and a meaningful title.\r\n4. Use one comparison from each chart to answer the data question. Explain what the pie chart adds to the stacked bar chart.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor to explain your code, output, or errors. Use its guidance to complete the chart yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
